# Slide Typography

User has repeatedly complained about three things. Treat all as bugs.

## 1. Fill the frame with type (vertical)

Body ≥ 20px. Punch / card titles ≥ 26–32px. Section labels ≥ 16px.
If a card stretches with `flex-1`, bump type first so copy fills the height. Do not leave a thin text band floating in a tall empty box.

## 2. Never stick to the frame (horizontal)

Text kissing a bordered card is a bug. **Left and right inner padding ≥ 40px** (`px-10` / `px-12`), equal on both sides. Do not use `px-3`–`px-4` on content cards.
Leave room on the right if a watermark number sits there (`pr-16`+ on titles).
Vertical fill ≠ shrinking horizontal padding.

## 3. Left–right align body copy

Card body / punch / intro paragraphs use `text-justify [text-justify:inter-ideograph]`.
Do not ship ragged-right Chinese paragraphs inside cards.

## 4. Never leave 1–2 characters on their own line

「满」「放大」「答案」单独掉行 = 必须改。Do this **before** shipping:

1. Break at a **phrase boundary** with explicit `<br />` (preferred)
2. Wrap the last 3 characters: `keepEnd(text, 3)` → `<span className="whitespace-nowrap">`
3. Shorten or rephrase the line so it fits
4. `whitespace-nowrap` only if the whole line truly fits

`tracking-widest` makes Chinese longer — measure wrap with that class on. Do not rely on the browser.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD — auto wrap, last char alone; text hugs the border
<h3 className="tracking-widest px-4">「宝安高端产业园」推荐被雪花科创城占满</h3>
<p className="text-left px-4">{detail}</p>

// ✅ GOOD — phrase break, padding, justify, keepEnd
<h3 className="px-12 pr-20">
  「宝安高端产业园」推荐
  <br />
  被雪花科创城占满
</h3>
<p className="px-12 text-justify [text-justify:inter-ideograph]">{keepEnd(detail)}</p>
```

When unsure on type size, go **one step larger**. When unsure on wrap, break earlier, not later.
